# print(shelf[at[0]]([1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], 1000), shelf[at[1]]([1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]), shelf[at[2]](3, 4), shelf[at[2]](32768, 65536), shelf[at[3]]([1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]));
